---
const quotes = [
  {
    role: 'U.S. founder, age 44',
    route: 'Real estate route',
    quote:
      'The filing was a title package and a funds trail, not a points interview. Permanent residency arrived as a single status, not a temporary card that had to be converted.',
  },
  {
    role: 'Canadian family office principal',
    route: 'Securities route',
    quote:
      'We did not want another property to administer. The brokerage book met the decree, sat in USD, and kept the immigration result identical to the real estate path.',
  },
  {
    role: 'EU entrepreneur, dual household',
    route: 'Real estate route',
    quote:
      'Dollar title in a territorial-tax jurisdiction, with no day-count to keep the card, was the reason for Panama over a European golden visa that still demanded presence.',
  },
];
---

<section class="section section--cream" id="profiles">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Applicant profiles</p>
      <h2>How the route is typically used</h2>
      <p>
        Composite sketches based on common filing patterns. They are not client testimonials and are not a representation of results.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      {
        quotes.map((item, i) => (
          <article class="bcard">
            <p class="kicker">{item.route}</p>
            <blockquote>
              <p>{item.quote}</p>
              <footer>{item.role}</footer>
            </blockquote>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro {
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  .intro h2 {
    margin: 1rem 0 1.1rem;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .bcard {
    padding: 1.8rem 1.55rem 1.7rem;
  }

  blockquote {
    margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
  }

  blockquote p {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  footer {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-label);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.9fr 0.9fr;
    }
  }
</style>
